  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit of NGO Mama-86</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision av Mama-86</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden har inte gjort en sista utbetalning till MAMA-86 under 2016 p&#xe5; grund av misstankar om oegentligheter. Ambassaden har utarbetat en uppdragsbeskrivning och avropat KPMG (ramavtal f&#xf6;r revision) f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra en revision av medel som anv&#xe4;ndes under 2016. KPMG har accepterat uppdraget.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy did not disburse the last tranche to MAMA-86 in 2016 due to suspicions of misuse of funds.  The Embassy has prepared a ToR for the audit and called-off KPMG (framework agreement for audit) to perform an audit of Swedish funds used by the organization in 2016. KPMG has accepted the assignment.</narrative>
  </description>
